;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Lots of cars are parked in the family restaurant's parking lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A stylish exterior and a lively atmosphere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a place a country girl like me isn't used to.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wow... so many people...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is it being on the empty side. When it's crowded, you have to wait a good 30 minutes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Prompted by the waitress, we sit down at an empty corner table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki-cho isn't as big a town as <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE>, but even this restaurant has such a big-city air that I can't settle down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Just so you know, people I know come here pretty often. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If you run into one of them, use a false name, to be safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A false name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She's been searching all this time for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">the child of the suspect in the Motoki-cho case</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If it got out that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> surname is 'Niimura,' it'd be a hassle, wouldn't it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But is that all right? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you want to know about the case too, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"For now, that matter can wait until </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> running away is settled."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm in the middle of a great conflict over whether I should tell him this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is probably torn the same way, over whether to draw it out of me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is chasing the culprit while being considerate of me, but at the same time he must think there's a connection between me and <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But for now, he isn't trying to push in any further than this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, that is.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh, could you tell me about the people who are looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">the culprit's child</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Let's see... I may as well have </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hear it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ah, but before that, let's order. Here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> hands me the menu.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a colorful, very stylish menu.<PG>
Normally I eat at Arata or have school lunch, so I'm not really used to things like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Steak... pizza... spaghetti...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Russian-roulette takoyaki?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The color's pretty, but it seems to be some kind of punishment game, so I don't need this one.<PG>
For now, I'll play it safe and just pick something from the spaghetti.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Um... peperoncino...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An oily, simple spaghetti with garlic and chili...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, I guess this'll do.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ドリンクバー.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I order this so-called peperoncino, order the mysterious system called a drink bar too, and take my seat again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Now then... it was about </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">the suspect's child</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the friends looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that child</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wasn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san's</STYLE> expression grows more serious, and the air freezes at this table alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voices of the other lively tables drift farther and farther away.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The child the suspect took away is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. She'd be 21 now, if she's alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew it! The name and the age match exactly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what does he mean, took her away?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A <STYLE ID="5">mother</STYLE> taking away <STYLE ID="4">her own daughter</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And the suspect is </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> mother. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Though I say mother, they're parent and child by adoption, with no blood tie."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Adopted!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I reacted to that word way too openly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> doesn't seem to take any notice of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think those two weren't really mother and daughter...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka Niimura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> real parents are the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">man</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> killed in the Motoki-cho case, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">his wife</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who was arrested and is now serving time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is being looked for by </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">her real younger sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and her friend―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">or rather than a friend, I guess she'd count as </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">a junior from school</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-wait a moment, sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's so much packed into this information, and sorting it out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, sorry. Shall I explain a little more carefully?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The one killed in the Motoki-cho case was 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> real father, <STYLE ID="6">Ryoji Kogori-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And her real mother is <STYLE ID="7">Akane Kogori-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason <STYLE ID="7">Akane-san</STYLE> was arrested, apparently, is that she was the one who actually carried out that Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> real parents had been negotiating with <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>, who was blackmailing the Kogori family, to get <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> back, but things got <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="こじ">tangled</STYLE>, and her <STYLE ID="6">father</STYLE> was killed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> younger sister, <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">She</STYLE> lives at her grandparents' house now, a little way from here, apparently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Natsumi-san's</STYLE> junior, <STYLE ID="9">Erina Goto-san</STYLE>, was very close to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, it seems, and she's apparently still tracking her down even now, together with <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi-san</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> sometimes comes to <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> too, to exchange information and talk things over, or so I hear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> is apparently sharp enough to exchange information with the police, but even so, she still hasn't managed to reach <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, that's about it for the people involved. Does anything come to mind?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not a word comes out of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that I can't say it; the facts about the people involved are so far from what I know that I'm shaken.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
That cheerful <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> was the mastermind of the Megasawa City case, and on top of that she killed <STYLE ID="6">Ryoji Kogori-san</STYLE>, who had helped her, by <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="は">flaying</STYLE>, a method cruel beyond measure, and then fled to the Arata settlement with <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even a country girl like me can tell that makes her a violent criminal of a kind rarely seen in history.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And what's more, <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> are covering for her.<PG>
Why would <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE>―no, why would the Arata settlement hide <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seems to be some deeper reason, more than just the slogan of one for all, all for one, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> probably wouldn't answer even if I asked him.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well? If it's hard to talk about, it can wait till later, all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I really don't think it has anything to do with me, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> must have figured out that I'm involved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, there's no way he'd tell me all this in such detail when I'm <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="・・・・">unrelated</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I knew something... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and kept quiet about it, what would you do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a hint that I've realized '<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> has realized I'm involved.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, a delicate game of bargaining is going on between <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> and me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Even if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> keep quiet, you're not the type who can keep quiet forever, are you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―once you're home, you probably won't be able to deal with the people around you the way you always have."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, I suppose..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've heard the suspect's name outright.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing that, to deal with <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> the way I always have...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Huh!? Wait a second...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Doesn't that mean I lose the place I've belonged until now?
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart will drift more than a little away from <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE>―no, from the settlement itself, and then I'll lose my place to belong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remember the words <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> said, 'kids who go astray do it because they have no place to belong.'<PG>
Was my choice a mistake?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I hadn't run away from facing <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> and had stayed in the settlement, I'd never have learned anything like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could have lifted the curse on my eyes without knowing, and gone back to the life I had until yesterday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could have gotten by without knowing the things better left unknown...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's why I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―I know the risk in drawing the story out of you, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―the more you know, the more </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> lose your place to belong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's not the kind of investigation I want."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then why did you tell me </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">the culprit's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> name!?"</STYLE><PG>
Honestly, I'm just taking it out on him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing that risk, <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> deliberately gave me information that shakes my place to belong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I'm the one who asked him to tell me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You've already realized, haven't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had nothing to do with it, hearing a story like this wouldn't mean anything to you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But if you're involved, then even if you go home, in the end you'll be feeling, 'Isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> the culprit?'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is probably right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I hadn't heard the culprit's name, I was already suspicious of <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
At last I understand why <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is telling me all this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> isn't trying to gather information from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He's doing what he can not to break my place to belong, which is already breaking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He's telling me to face my place to belong knowing the truth, instead of going home with eyes full of suspicion.<PG>
My real name, which I revealed to <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> on the way to Motoki-cho, and the surname 'Niimura' that it leads to―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that point, even <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> probably didn't think the story would connect this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it's gradually closing in on the truth, and now even I'm no longer unrelated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because right now the one closest to the truth is me, and the one being driven furthest into a corner is also me.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm grateful for your kindness."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh... what are you saying... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I have no idea what you're talking about..."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> makes a slightly embarrassed gesture.<PG>
"Sorry to keep you waiting."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The waitress brought over the food we'd ordered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ペペロンチーノ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, that's enough grim talk for now. It'll spoil the meal."</STYLE><PG>
But the taste of this so-called peperoncino, which I'm eating for the first time, is already lost on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand that in my usual state of mind, it would surely taste delicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... what should I do from here on?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could cure the curse on my eyes right now and make it all as if it never happened, I'd face <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> this very minute.<PG>
But it's not on that level anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> is a vicious murderer, and the Arata settlement is <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="いんとく">concealing</STYLE> it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a place like that to be my place to belong...<PG>
At first I thought it was my duty to keep it hidden the same way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But is that really all right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that really justice?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, well? Isn't that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
