{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And the one who's appeared is a very cute woman, petite and childlike in looks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This person... I've seen her somewhere...<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. What a coincidence. Are you here with someone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No, I'm meeting someone here today! </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is coming a little later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="9">the woman called Goto-chan</STYLE> turns her eyes toward me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
