{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, well, well? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! You finally laid a hand on another girl?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"D-don't be stupid! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is, er... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a distant relative of mine!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Right? Right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He sends me the same look begging for agreement that he gave me at that soba shop.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, yes! My name's </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ふるむらあきな">Akina Furumura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'm staying at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dai-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> place today!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ohh? I see, I see!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I'm Erina Goto!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="9">Honestly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, just because I turn 20 this year, taking such </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">a young little pretty girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> out to dinner..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I don't have that kind of relationship!"</STYLE><PG>
So <STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> turns 20 this year. She looks even younger than her real age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it seems <STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> is trying to pin down <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> whereabouts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't afford a careless conversation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="あきな">Akina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, where are you from?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> flashes a big grin and talks to me <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="な">over</STYLE>-<STYLE ID="19" RUBY="な">familiarly</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, leave it... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has been through a lot, and she's heartbroken right now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="9">"Whoops, my mistake..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE> quickly pulls back from where she'd started to lean in.<PG>
But even after that, she keeps staring at me with great interest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking the way I do, I get looked at like this all the time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm used to it by now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ペペロンチーノ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
