{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now she turns her eyes to my food.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, the way I feel, I can't really taste it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">This person</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
is a little dangerous...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
