{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That moment, a sensation I've never felt before comes over me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an instant time stops, and instinctively I feel a violent discomfort at being here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then my sweat glands begin to open, trying to break out in a cold sweat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This situation... is dangerous...!<PG>
Is this the danger sense <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> was talking about?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, then danger from what, exactly...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The question crosses my mind, but what it really is becomes clear right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Erina Goto</STYLE>, right in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">This person</STYLE> is my threat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
