Not just because I think it's dangerous, but flustered by this first-ever sensation too, I get up from my seat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレストイレ反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
