<STYLE ID="1">"Haah...! Haah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gasp for breath in a restroom stall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I wipe away the single drop of sweat that's run down my forehead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that just now was sensing danger... the intuition <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> has too, only at this time of year.<PG>
I have to be careful of <STYLE ID="9">that person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Getting involved with <STYLE ID="9">that person</STYLE> is extremely dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'll see through who I really am in no time and reach the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then <STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Mommy</STYLE> will be arrested―
{PAUSE ""}
and I'll lose my place to belong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My instinct warned me so.<PG>
Calm down. Calm down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can just slip away from here quietly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being with <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> means being with <STYLE ID="9">Erina Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't have anything more to do with <STYLE ID="9">that person</STYLE>!<PG>
But my bag is in <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san's</STYLE> car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a change of clothes in it, and two knives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At worst, I could ditch the bag and run, but...<PG>
Calm down, once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sensed <STYLE ID="9">Erina Goto</STYLE> as dangerous because she'd probe me and try to get <STYLE ID="5">Auntie's</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> whereabouts out of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I just need to keep my answers to the bare minimum.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm about to give a bad answer, my danger sense should kick in again like just now.<PG>
